OL,3,AWhy I don't always tell potential
OL,4,Aemployers I'm dyslexic
OL,5,
OL,6,FNineteen-year-old Ayana Bailey doesn't
OL,7,Falways disclose her dyslexia in job
OL,8,Fapplications, in case it counts against
OL,9,Fher.
OL,11,F"It's not like there's going to be a
OL,12,Ftarget on my back, but I'm just like,
OL,13,F'maybe they won't select me'," says
OL,14,FBailey, a part-time florist.
OL,16,FA British Dyslexia Association (BDA)
OL,17,Fsurvey of more than 1,200 working
OL,18,Fdyslexic adults found Bailey isn't
OL,19,Falone - with 46% hiding their dyslexia
OL,20,Fat work.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
